Package: GvizRegulatoryTracks
Type: Package
Title: Score-Scaled Sequence, Motif, and Directional Tracks for Gviz
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Froehlich", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jonathan.froehlich@gmail.com")
Author: Jonathan Froehlich [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jonathan Froehlich <jonathan.froehlich@gmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/jjfroehlich/GvizRegulatoryTracks
BugReports: https://github.com/jjfroehlich/GvizRegulatoryTracks/issues
Description: Adds Grid-based Gviz custom tracks for signed, base-resolution
    nucleotide scores, genomic motif logos, and fixed-tip directional ranges.
    Score tracks scale each nucleotide by its value and delegate overview
    rendering to Gviz DataTrack, motif tracks place strand-aware
    information-content logos at genomic motif matches, and directional tracks
    preserve a constant physical arrowhead width across genomic zoom levels.
